# The Drop - Environment Variables Guide for Vercel Deployment

# -------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. DATABASE & PERSISTENCE (Highly Recommended for Vercel)
# -------------------------------------------------------------
# On Vercel, serverless instances are ephemeral. Connecting Redis 
# ensures clipboards & presence persist across all lambdas.
# In Vercel Dashboard: Click "Storage" -> "Create Database" -> "KV" or "Upstash Redis"
# Vercel automatically populates either KV_REST_API_* or UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_*:

UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=

# Or Vercel KV defaults:
KV_REST_API_URL=
KV_REST_API_TOKEN=

# -------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. FILE UPLOADS (Optional - Zero-Config Fallback is Built-in)
# -------------------------------------------------------------
# The app includes built-in server-side storage for photos, 
# voice notes, and documents. If you want external CDN storage:

CLOUDINARY_CLOUD_NAME=
CLOUDINARY_API_KEY=
CLOUDINARY_API_SECRET=
